# package-disable.template.xfcmd
# TEMPLATE for a disable script. Runs on: liboff <your-package>
# Register it in cmd.json: "disable": "<your-package>.disable.xfcmd"
# Snippets added by the package are removed automatically. Files are never deleted.
say "Disabled {name}."
say "Demo files were kept. Delete demos/{name}-demo.fscss if you do not need it."
